          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>One incoming color average</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>Particle.color_sum</code> counts three incoming color states, and its averaged identity has unit trace. Summing the two outgoing colors and averaging the incoming color gives <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(6/3=2||)</marimo-tex> for either vertex. The outgoing species are distinct, so no identical-particle factor is required.</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">2</div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">2</div></div>"
          }
